00">Zonas populares</p><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">El Poblado</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">Laureles</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">Belén</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">Estadio</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">Centro</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">Ciudad del Río</span></div></div><div class="mt-4"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-neutral-500">Busquedas frecuentes</p><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">Escorts en Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">Escorts Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">escorts en Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">escorts Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">escorts medellin</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">escorts en medellin</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">prepagos medellin</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">acompanantes medellin</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">prepagos en Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">prepagos Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">putas en Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">putas Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">acompanantes en Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">damas de compania en Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">chicas en Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">masajistas en Medellín</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-200">universitarias en Medellín</span></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-md border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.03] p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-100">Donde encontrar escorts en Medellín?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-400">En BelaClub puedes revisar 46 perfiles visibles y aprobados en Medellín, Antioquia. La pagina prioriza perfiles activos, fotos publicas y contacto directo por WhatsApp.</p></article><article class="rounded-md border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.03] p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-100">Que zonas de Medellín se pueden revisar?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-400">Las busquedas se organizan alrededor de El Poblado, Laureles, Belén, Estadio y Centro. Tambien puedes revisar busquedas cercanas en Envigado, Itagui, Sabaneta y Rionegro.</p></article><article class="rounded-md border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.03] p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-100">La pagina de Escorts en Medellín se actualiza?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-400">Si. La pagina usa los perfiles activos, visibles y aprobados dentro de BelaClub, por eso el listado puede cambiar cuando se aprueban, pausan o actualizan perfiles.</p></article><article class="rounded-md border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.03] p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-100">Tambien sirve para buscar prepagos, acompañantes, damas de compañía, chicas, masajistas, universitarias y putas en Medellín?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-400">Si. BelaClub conecta busquedas relacionadas con paginas filtradas por ciudad para que el usuario pueda comparar categorias sin salir del contexto local.</p></article></div><nav aria-label="Mas busquedas" class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/prepagos/medellin">Prepagos en Medellín</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/acompanantes/medellin">Acompañantes en Medellín</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/damas-de-compania/medellin">Damas de compañía en Medellín</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/chicas/medellin">Chicas en Medellín</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/masajistas/medellin">Masajistas en Medellín</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/universitarias/medellin">Universitarias en Medellín</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/putas/medellin">Putas en Medellín</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/escorts/rionegro">Escorts en Rionegro</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/escorts/la-ceja">Escorts en La Ceja</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/escorts/bello">Escorts en Bello</a><a class="rounded-full border border-blue-300/20 bg-blue-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-100 transition hover:border-blue-200/35 hover:bg-blue-400/15" href="/escorts/zipaquira">Escorts en Zipaquirá</a></nav></section></section></main><footer class="border-t border-white/[0.08] px-4 py-8 text-sm text-neutral-500 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-